id: zw_nostrip
label: Z-Wave No Strip
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  When present, the linker is not passed -s (strip), so symbols already in the object
  files remain in the final binary. Useful for post-mortem or crash analysis. Typically
  for internal or diagnostic builds. This component only controls the linker strip; it
  does not change how symbols are generated.
package: zwave
quality: production
provides:
- name: zw_nostrip
root_path: zwave
